<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Placer agrees to Highlands plan.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Placer agrees to Highlands plan.</headline>
<dateline>BRISBANE 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Highlands Gold Ltd said on Thursday Placer Dome Inc had agreed to its restructuring plan which involved the spin-off of a new company that would hold Highlands' non-Porgera gold mine assets in Papua New Guinea.</p>
<p>Highlands said under the restructuring it recommended shareholders accept the Placer Dome takeover offer of 75 cents per share.</p>
<p>It said the new company, Highland Pacific Ltd, would raise A$190 million through an underwritten equity issue.</p>
</text>
